<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting the School of Music Admissions office. Since you are a current student in BLANK, you will not need to submit the prescreening audition for the Doctor of Musical Arts: Performance application. However, because the application requires a prescreening video, please prepare a short audio recording stating the following:</font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Current Major</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Studio Instructor</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The prescreening requirement is waived because you are a current master’s student</span></li></ul></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">When you are ready to submit your application, please request a promo code for the $25 prescreening fee by emailing <a href="mailto:musicadmissions@asu.edu">MusicAdmissions@asu.edu</a>. Please note that you will still need to pay the $10 application fee.</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thanks,</font></div><div><br></div></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Julie Stephens</b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" color="#999999">Coordinator, Academic Affairs + Admissions</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font>&nbsp;|&nbsp;</b></font><b style="color: rgb(255, 204, 0); font-size: 12pt;">Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts&nbsp;</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">P.O. Box 870405 |&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);">Tempe, Arizona 85287-0405</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#999999">Phone: 480-965-5069</font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>